, dict): return []` yields zero findings and exit 0 — so the audit tool an operator runs to detect store corruption cannot see it.","id":"1","impact":0.3,"location":"src/rebar/_engine_support/bridge_fsck.py:180","norm_id":"n813089bcbaa40e47","priority":0.2571,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8571,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"yes","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"yes","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"insufficient","path_reachable":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"insufficient"},"severity_attributes":{"blast_radius":"local","capability_degraded":true,"churn90":0,"contract_drift":false,"data_loss_without_recovery":false,"dead_code":false,"debt_impact":"medium","escapes_automation":true,"hard_to_reverse_surface":false,"hidden_invariant":true,"implicit_coupling":false,"likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reachable_path_without_automated_coverage":false,"reversibility":"easy","safety_net_removal_without_replacement":false,"security_bypass_not_enforced_elsewhere":false,"silent_failure":true,"silent_wrong_feeding_a_decision":false,"trigger_likelihood":"rare","unversioned_published_contract_break":false}}},{"agreement":1,"block_threshold":0.95,"blocking_enabled":false,"checklist_item":"- [ ] Make the store-integrity/binding-drift arms read bindings.json from the same committed ref as the event scan (or document that they require a working-tree checkout and only the event scan is checkout-free).","criteria":["correctness","maintainability"],"decision":"advisory","evidence":["Event scan reads the ref: bridge_fsck.py:131 `_TICKETS_REF` = 'refs/heads/tickets' passed to git grep/show","Store integrity reads the working tree: bridge_fsck.py:180 `_read_json(tickets_tracker / '.bridge_state' / 'bindings.json')`","docs/release-notes.md:16-18: 'It does not require a tickets checkout ... validates both directions of bindings.json'","Absent working-tree file -> `if not isinstance(store, dict): return []` (bridge_fsck.py:181-182) so integrity is reported clean"],"finding":"The unknown-event scan reads the committed ref refs/heads/tickets while audit_store_integrity and audit_binding_drift read the working-tree file .bridge_state/bindings.json; the two arms therefore inspect different snapshots and the store arms silently return [] when the working-tree file is absent, despite release notes stating fsck 'does not require a tickets checkout'.","id":"2","impact":0.3,"location":"src/rebar/_engine_support/bridge_fsck.py:178","norm_id":"n95cb4ceff935ce5a","priority":0.2571,"reason":"default-advisory","scenarios":[],"severity":"minor","suggested_fix":"","tier":"LLM","validity":0.8571,"verification":{"binary":{"absence_confirmed_in_context":"na","asserted_capability_confirmed":"na","cited_reference_accurate":"yes","claims_absence":"no","committed_work_relies_on_unbacked_claim":"na","evidence_entails_finding":"yes","impact_follows_necessarily":"yes","is_verifiable":"yes","no_existing_mitigation":"yes","no_viable_alternative_explanation":"insufficient","path_reachable":"yes","respects_artifact_altitude":"na","severity_claim_justified":"insufficient"},"severity_attributes":{"blast_radius":"local","capability_degraded":true,"churn90":0,"contract_drift":true,"data_loss_without_recovery":false,"dead_code":false,"debt_impact":"medium","escapes_automation":true,"hard_to_reverse_surface":false,"hidden_invariant":true,"implicit_coupling":false,"likelihood":"low","prod_impact":"low","reachable_path_without_automated_coverage":false,"reversibility":"moderate","safety_net_removal_without_replacement":false,"security_bypass_not_enforced_elsewhere":false,"silent_failure":true,"silent_wrong_feeding_a_decision":